# Material for apriltag_plate.obj.
#
# map_Kd resolves RELATIVE TO THIS FILE, so the PNG sits in this same meshes/
# directory rather than under materials/ — that keeps the texture out of
# Gazebo's resource-path resolution entirely, which is one less thing to get
# wrong.
#
# The PNG is NOT in git. Generate it with:
#     scripts/make_apriltag_texture.sh
# Without it the plate renders plain white and nothing detects — the world
# still loads, so a missing texture looks like a detection bug. Run the script.
#
# Ks 0 and a flat illum: an AprilTag is a matte printed sheet. A specular
# highlight across it is a real way to lose detections, in sim as on a robot.
newmtl tag
Ka 1.000 1.000 1.000
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
Ks 0.000 0.000 0.000
d 1.0
illum 1
map_Kd tag36h11_00000.png
